message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "4Cast Lab: Open-source app for machine learning and statistical analyses"
abstract: "A free, open-source application for machine learning, econometrics and statistical analysis that runs with no installation and no data leaving the user's computer. It implements eight families of learners, enforces leakage-safe validation for time-ordered data, compares every model against naive benchmarks with formal predictive-accuracy tests, and documents each run in a methods report."
